 ${x}_{1}={x}_{2}={x}_{3}=0.$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186448904}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045486} :question/id #uuid "e39d7a95-6796-5061-a2aa-706f3f881251" :question/math-academy-id "q-105315" :question/problem "Consider the following vectors:\n\n$$\n{a}_{1}=\\begin{bmatrix}-3 \\\\ 9 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix},\\,{a}_{2}=\\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ -5 \\\\ -2\\end{bmatrix},\\,{a}_{3}=\\begin{bmatrix}5 \\\\ -12 \\\\ -4\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nAssume that ${x}_{1},{x}_{2},$ and ${x}_{3}$ are real numbers. Which of the following statements are true?\n\nSelect all that apply." :question/worked-solution "We say that three vectors ${v}_{1},{v}_{2},$ and ${v}_{3}$ are *linearly independent* if the only solution to the equation\n\n$$\n{x}_{1}{v}_{1}+{x}_{2}{v}_{2}+{x}_{3}{v}_{3}=0\n$$\n\nis ${x}_{1}={x}_{2}={x}_{3}=0.$ Otherwise, the vectors are *linearly dependent*.\n\nWith that in mind, let's examine our statements.\n\nThe equation ${x}_{1}{a}_{1}+{x}_{2}{a}_{2}+{x}_{3}{a}_{3}=0$ corresponds to the system \n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}-3{x}_{1}+2{x}_{2}+5{x}_{3} &=0 \\\\ 9{x}_{1}-5{x}_{2}-12{x}_{3} &=0 \\\\ -2{x}_{2}-4{x}_{3} &=0.\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nTo solve the system, we create its augmented matrix and reduce it using Gaussian elimination:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}M & =\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}-3 & 2 & 5 & 0 \\\\ 9 & -5 & -12 & 0 \\\\ 0 & -2 & -4 & 0\\end{array}\\right] & {R}_{2} & :={R}_{2}+3{R}_{1} \\\\  & ∼\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}-3 & 2 & 5 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 3 & 0 \\\\ 0 & -2 & -4 & 0\\end{array}\\right] & {R}_{3} & :={R}_{3}+2{R}_{2} \\\\  & ∼\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}-3 & 2 & 5 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 3 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 2 & 0\\end{array}\\right]\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, the system is now\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}-3{x}_{1}+2{x}_{2}+5{x}_{3} &=0 \\\\ {x}_{2}+3{x}_{3} &=0 \\\\ 2{x}_{3} &=0.\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nFrom the third equation, we get ${x}_{3}=0.$ Substituting this into the second equation, we get\n\n$$\n{x}_{2}+3(0)=0\\,⟹\\,{x}_{2}=0\n$$\n\nand, substituting this into the first equation, we obtain\n\n$$\n-3{x}_{1}+2(0)+5(0)=0\\,⟹\\,{x}_{1}=0.\n$$\n\nSince ${x}_{1}={x}_{2}={x}_{3}=0$, we get that the set $\\{{a}_{1},{a}_{2},{a}_{3}\\}$ is linearly independent.\n\nTherefore, statements “The vectors ${a}_{1},{a}_{2},$ and ${a}_{3}$ are linearly independent” and “The equation ${x}_{1}{a}_{1}+{x}_{2}{a}_{2}+{x}_{3}{a}_{3}=0$ has only the trivial solution ${x}_{1}={x}_{2}={x}_{3}=0.$” are true, while statement “The vectors ${a}_{1},{a}_{2},$ and ${a}_{3}$ are linearly dependent” is false."}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186241038 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "119902b6-653e-5dd6-8fa5-3d6771e4a1c0" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186447730} {:answer/id #uuid "b1c8f107-a908-59a2-bf5c-916b59b08aa0" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186447731}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "b1c8f107-a908-59a2-bf5c-916b59b08aa0" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186447731} :answer-field/id #uuid "e9bbe3de-380f-5883-ac7f-def1d9e1b0c6" :answer-field/key "The vectors ${a}_{1},{a}_{2},$ and ${a}_{3}$ are linearly independent." :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186448905} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "5728916d-87d9-52c5-a916-0ccca10350a9" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186447732} {:answer/id #uuid "c4d20f68-6911-50cc-a7fa-489d0b7dfea3" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186447733}] :answer-fie